  "adaptation": {
    "semantic": "\"make up\" has unrelated translations: *invent* (a story), *form* (a group), *become friends again*, *complete* (an amount), *prepare* (a bed), and *put on face color*. Choose by the object.",
    "grammar": "In the form sense the parts are the subject (*women make up half the team*), or the whole is passive (*the team is made up of women and men*). In the invent sense a pronoun goes in the middle: *make it up*.",
